      </div>

    <p class="profile-summary" id="summary"><em>London was founded by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/roman-empire">Romans</a> as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/londinium">Londinium</a> about 47 CE on the Thames. It survived destruction by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/boudica">Boudica</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vikings">Viking</a> attack, plague, fire and bombing, became the seat of English government at Westminster, and grew into the world's largest city in the 19th century.</em></p>

